{"name":"Tangier","hex":"#a97164","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Tangier","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A port city, the capital of the region of Tangier-Tetouan-Al Hoceima, Morocco, on the Strait of Gibraltar.","The former international zone surrounding the city; its administration."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Tangier"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tangier","blocks":[{"text":"Tangier, also called Tangiers, is a city in northwestern Morocco, on the coasts of the Mediterranean Sea and the Atlantic Ocean. The city is the capital of the Tangier-Tetouan-Al Hoceima region, as well as the Tangier-Assilah Prefecture of Morocco."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Tanger_cor.jpg/330px-Tanger_cor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tangier","wikidata":"Q126148"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Muralla%2C_T%C3%A1nger%2C_Marruecos%2C_2015-12-11%2C_DD_57-68_HDR_PAN.JPG/500px-Muralla%2C_T%C3%A1nger%2C_Marruecos%2C_2015-12-11%2C_DD_57-68_HDR_PAN.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Muralla%2C_T%C3%A1nger%2C_Marruecos%2C_2015-12-11%2C_DD_57-68_HDR_PAN.JPG/1280px-Muralla%2C_T%C3%A1nger%2C_Marruecos%2C_2015-12-11%2C_DD_57-68_HDR_PAN.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Muralla%2C_T%C3%A1nger%2C_Marruecos%2C_2015-12-11%2C_DD_57-68_HDR_PAN.JPG/500px-Muralla%2C_T%C3%A1nger%2C_Marruecos%2C_2015-12-11%2C_DD_57-68_HDR_PAN.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMuralla%2C_T%C3%A1nger%2C_Marruecos%2C_2015-12-11%2C_DD_57-68_HDR_PAN.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/comm